@nizivo/react includes material from the following third-party projects.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lucide (https://lucide.dev), lucide-static 1.56.0

The internal glyphs in dist/_internal/glyphs.js reuse the SVG path data of these
Lucide icons:

  loader-circle      (the Button and IconButton pending spinner)
  chevron-right      (the Breadcrumb separator and the Pagination previous/next marks)
  chevrons-up-down   (the Select trigger indicator)
  circle-x           (the Field, Fieldset and InlineError error mark, the critical Toast mark)
  circle-check       (the success Toast mark)
  info               (the neutral Toast mark)
  x                  (the AlertDismiss close mark)
  check              (the Checkbox checked mark)
  minus              (the Checkbox indeterminate dash, the QuantityStepper decrement mark)
  plus               (the QuantityStepper increment mark)
  eye                (the PasswordInput toggle while the password is hidden)
  eye-off            (the PasswordInput toggle while the password is shown)
  search             (the SearchField magnifier)
  ellipsis           (the MobileTabBar More mark)
  calendar           (the DateRangePicker trigger mark)
  sparkles           (the AI kit's mark: AiBadge, SuggestionChip, UsageMeter)
  globe              (the SourceCard web mark)
  file-text          (the SourceCard file mark)
  thumbs-up          (the FeedbackBar Good answer vote)
  thumbs-down        (the FeedbackBar Bad answer vote)
  wand-sparkles      (the ToolCallCard mark)
  circle-alert       (the ResponseBlock error mark)
  circle-stop        (the ResponseBlock Stop generating mark)
  refresh-cw         (the ResponseBlock Retry mark)
  mic                (the VoiceOrb start mark)
  arrow-up           (the PromptComposer send mark)
  star               (the Rating stars)
  heart              (the Comment Like mark)
  message-circle     (the Comment Reply mark)
  clock              (the EventCard time mark)

